{"id":"b2f352f2-ac4d-4e08-938a-f349bb26a26d","object":"chat.completion","created":1793244797,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"thought\":\"p46 gives CAMEL detail: two agents (assistant and user) exchange messages starting from an 'inception prompt'—likely the answer to camel_prompting—and a third critic agent keeps communication constructive; Generative Agents uses memory, planning, reflection modules. Record this.\",\"code\":\"write_note(title='multi_agent', content='补记 p46：CAMEL 是两个 agent（assistant 与 user），各自先给一个 inception prompt（初始想法），随后互相发送消息推进任务；实践中出现重复指令、假回复、空回复、无限循环与角色反转，故引入第三個 critic agent 保证建设性交流；HumanEval 由 30% 提升到约 50%。Generative Agents 用记忆、计划、反思三模块，agent 数约 5-15，行为非脚本化涌现（起床做饭、上班、形成观点、发起对话）；与 CAMEL 全在上下文提示中指定行为不同，它另有外部记忆/计划/反思算法。引用可用：Both agents are given a so-called inception prompt。', evidence_ids=['ev-75546d247dedb90561b5'], section='multi_agent')\"}"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":7938,"completion_tokens":251,"total_tokens":8189,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":4480},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":4480,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":3458},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}